<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-21T19:35:09.017Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard arrested two drug suspects and seized ₱2.38 million of suspected shabu in Pagadian City while also seeking drones and cybersecurity assistance from Australia and signing a maritime cooperation pact with Finland. Rescue teams saved 22 people from a distressed boat off Palawan and are searching for a woman swept away at a waterfall in Ipoh, while the Coast Guard is boosting its presence in Talisay and tightening checks on mineral shipments to Cebu. President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr. expressed optimism for improved Philippines-China relations after a conversation with Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi in Shenzhen. The UCDP reported 176 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQU3hfcTQ3UG9kaE9NZTdEN2JyazhldkJGaWRzYzk2cG03bnBXaThack5aTWxXRzA3UVpuN084dEN2aUxpYzNFUzhTNTBCNmZzWHhJYmJOOHc0QVdpbXhYcU1KNS01WFN4eXFvSTB6OXo2UWtyaTBpaWxMZUhPdzdUbGFydHBCTzhXanMwZUZYRlFOYmVrcTdocy0zYUU4cWpYX2ZfMjU1NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNcDNUelFNQW9QWEZOSVNOOVdBZHhoS0JBVlB1aVh6c3Z2dWxUd3R2bUdiZ0c2MkNkTUNic2UwajJkTWZjQ3ByTTJfdHAzUGh5WG1qR3JSejM5YmVsUEhjTG4tc2ctSk9udWlHSTR1Um1uZ252ejRPVGRWaWJFTFJsQWN5bnFSVENfdWpibWVyVXNlLXBYVm9yNFBRTTZwOWJKSF9rNVRuTVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNMEpHTkc1Y09KQkxpc2hyamVCNGw5aHVsQlBwWGM5eTNZOUFVSmYzTXMxd2t3VzFDZWVRNTdsaFpPejR5SUlNekpCQzhWSlBOWVBqVkJoV1V2MlVqOHVtUTZwY3RWZ2xvSlViVE5UUHNKOTdROG5VUy1QRW1ENGJYRXgyMC1sdkk?oc=5&quot;&gt;D